# IT Forensic Report – m.dubois (request HR-2026-011)

**Requested by:** C. Lemaire (e-mail 09/03/2026) – **Performed:** 10–11/03/2026

## Sources reviewed
- DLP event details (5/03/2026 18:12–18:19).
- Browser upload log on laptop TEC-LT-0842.
- **Full mailbox content** of m.dubois, 01/02–10/03/2026 (keyword search "DataNova", "gmail", "pricing").

*Note: no prior information of the employee or individualisation procedure under CCT 81 was carried out – urgent request from HR.*

## Results
1. 3 uploads to drive.google.com (personal account marc.dubois84) on 05/03 between 18:12 and 18:16, totalling 4,312 CRM records and 1 pricing file.
2. 1 e-mail forward of Pricing_2026_confidential.xlsx to marc.dubois84@gmail.com at 18:19.
3. No further uploads after 05/03.
4. Mailbox: 2 private e-mails (subject "Opportunité – DataNova", 24/02 and 03/03) with a recruiter at DataNova.
5. VPN logs show 14 disconnections on 05/03 between 16:00 and 18:10.

Kristof Janssens, IT Security Manager

