# Memo – Leak of 2027 budget figures (strictly confidential)

**To:** Philippe Dumont (CEO), Catherine Lemaire (HR Director) – **From:** Sarah Lefèvre (CFO)

1. On 28 May 2026 a newspaper published our draft 2027 budget figures ("Tectonic plans 12% cost cut").
2. Only 6 people had the draft: the Management Committee, Jan Peeters and myself.
3. On 1 June I asked IT Security to review Jan's mailbox. The review (2 June) found e-mails marked "PRIVÉ" with a journalist of the newspaper, including one titled "RE: ton article" dated 27 May.
4. The content of these e-mails does not contain the budget file, but mentions "the numbers we discussed".
5. I propose a dismissal for serious cause. **HR was not involved before the mailbox review; the works council has never been informed about individual mailbox checks.**

Sarah Lefèvre, CFO

